MANUAL 12207 12272
12207: PR Format              Summary of Operation  Instruction Code  Execution
12208:                        FPSCR.FR=~FPSCR.FR                      States T Bit
12209:                        --
12210: 0  FRCHG                                     1111101111111101 1    --
12211: 
12212: 1  --                                        --                --  --
12213: 
12214: Description
12215: 
12216: This instruction inverts the FR bit in floating-point register FPSCR. When the FR bit in FPSCR is
12217: changed, FR0 to FR15 in FPR0_BANK0 to FPR15_BANK0 and FPR0_BANK1 to
12218: FPR15_BANK1 become XR0 to XR15, and XR0 to XR15 become FR0 to FR15. When
12219: FPSCR.FR = 0, FPR0_BANK0 to FPR15_BANK0 correspond to FR0 to FR15, and
12220: FPR0_BANK1 to FPR15_BANK1 correspond to XR0 to XR15. When FPSCR.FR = 1,
12221: FPR0_BANK1 to FPR15_BANK1 correspond to FR0 to FR15, and FPR0_BANK0 to
12222: FPR15_BANK0 correspond to XR0 to XR15.
12223: 
12224: Operation
12225: 
12226:    void FRCHG() /* FRCHG */
12227:    {
12228: 
12229:             if(FPSCR_PR == 0){
12230:                    FPSCR ^= 0x00200000; /* bit 21 */
12231:                    PC += 2;
12232: 
12233:             }
12234:             else undefined_operation();
12235:    }
12236: 
12237: Possible Exceptions:
12238: None
12239: 
12240:                                                  Rev. 5.0, 04/01, page 269 of 394
12241: 9.42 FSCHG             Sz-bit CHanGe             Floating-Point Instruction
12242: 
12243:             SZ Bit
12244:             Inversion
12245: 
12246: PR Format              Summary of Operation  Instruction Code  Execution
12247:                        FPSCR.SZ=~FPSCR.SZ                      States T Bit
12248:                        --
12249: 0  FSCHG                                     1111001111111101 1    --
12250: 
12251: 1  --                                        --                --  --
12252: 
12253: Description
12254: 
12255: This instruction inverts the SZ bit in floating-point register FPSCR. Changing the SZ bit in
12256: FPSCR switches FMOV instruction data transfer between one single-precision data unit and a data
12257: pair. When FPSCR.SZ = 0, the FMOV instruction transfers one single-precision data unit. When
12258: FPSCR.SZ = 1, the FMOV instruction transfers two single-precision data units as a pair.
12259: 
12260: Operation
12261: 
12262:    void FSCHG() /* FSCHG */
12263:    {
12264: 
12265:             if(FPSCR_PR == 0){
12266:                    FPSCR ^= 0x00100000; /* bit 20 */
12267:                    PC += 2;
12268: 
12269:             }
12270:             else undefined_operation();
12271:    }
